    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Oates Breheny Group are delighted to present Apartment 1, Cois In Bhear to the market, a three-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment enjoying beautiful views over the Garavogue River and Sligo Harbour. The accommodation is bright and well proportioned throughout. The living/dining area features floor-length windows, allowing an abundance of natural light to fill the room while taking full advantage of the attractive views. This space is finished with laminate wood flooring. From the living area, there is access to the fully fitted kitchen, which features tiled flooring and splashback along with storage and worktop space. The apartment comprises three well-proportioned double bedrooms, one of which benefits from its own en suite, while the remaining bedrooms are served by a shared main bathroom. A standout feature of this property is its own designated parking space within the secure underground car park. The location is particularly convenient, with Sligo Town Centre approximately a five-minute walk away, providing an extensive range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, and sports and recreational amenities. Sligo Bus Station and Train Station are also within walking distance, while a local bus stop is situated just one minute from the property. With spacious accommodation, secure underground parking, impressive views and an excellent location close to Sligo Town Centre, Apartment 1, Cois In Bhear offers an attractive opportunity for a wide range of purchasers. To arrange a viewing, contact Oates Breheny Group on 071-9140404. This sale is joint with Murphy And Sons Auctioneers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall  \r\nCarpet flooring. Hot press.\r\n\r\nKitchen (3.03m x 2.59m) \r\nFully fitted kitchen with integrated oven, hob and extractor fan. Tiled flooring and splashback. \r\n\r\nLiving/ Dining Room (7.91m x 4.75m) \r\nLaminate wood flooring throughout. Generous front facing window with beautiful views of the Garavogue river and Sligo harbour. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (3.67m x 3.14m) \r\nDouble room. Laminate wood flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.74m x 2.78m) \r\nDouble room. Laminate wood flooring.\r\n\r\nEn Suite (1.37m x 2.52m) \r\nTiled floor to ceiling. WC & WHB. Shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (2.58m x 3.57m) \r\nDouble room. Laminate wood flooring. \r\n\r\nBathroom (3.16m x 1.88m)\r\nTiled floor to ceiling. WC & WHB. Shower over bath."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Electric storage heating.\r\nDouble glazed windows.\r\nParking space in underground secure car park.\r\nBeautiful views of Garavogue river and Sligo harbour. \r\nApproximately a 5-minute walk to Sligo Town Centre, offering an extensive range of shops, cafés and restaurants, schools, sports and recreational amenities, as well as Sligo Bus Station and Sligo Train Station."
      },
